<title>INDIA: India Lakshmi Machine offers 1:1 bonus.</title>
<headline>India Lakshmi Machine offers 1:1 bonus.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indian textile machinery firm Lakshmi Machine Works on Wednesday said it would offer investors one bonus share for every one share held.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
